        rdfs:label "models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py L1272–L1314" ;
        dcterms:description "Four spiculogenesis ablations (templated_secondary, untemplated_control, primary_dominant_ablation, no_secondary_ablation)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py#L1272-L1314> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-parameter-expressivity-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py L908–L974" ;
        dcterms:description "Depth sweep delta/delta_on in {1, 2, 4, 6} for lattice vs monolith; monolith onset calibration" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py#L908-L974> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Yang et al. (2022) & Donnay & Pawson (1969) biogenic single-crystal calcite TPMS echinoderm stereom (Diamond D, Gyroid G, Primitive P), Gibson-Ashby cellular mechanics, nanoindentation twin-band arrest FEM & syncytial ACC templating — Parameter expressivity: 88/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Credit: the five TPMS/ablation regimes and 17-point threshold sweep remain (L479-544); Pass 3 adds a four-depth sweep lattice vs monolith (L908-974), four pile-up glide lengths (L871-905), four templating ablations (wild type / untemplated / primary-dominant / no-secondary, L1272-1314) and the CLI gains `--n-fe` and `--tau-twin` alongside `--a0`, `--c-thresh`, `--e-calcite`, `--n-grid`, `--seed` (L2156-2164), all routed through `compute_pass3_models()` (L1319-1331). Deductions: `--a0` now drives only the Pass 3 section/templating — Panel A/F extents still use DEFAULT_A0_UM (L1384-1398) (-3); `--c-thresh` only moves the drawn contour level in Panel A (L1357, L1390, L1398), not the regimes (JSON thresholds) nor any measurement (-3); `measure_morphoeval()` ignores all CLI overrides (L1842-1849) (-3); `--seed` affects only the spinodal control and spiculogenesis (-1); the twin-plane angle, twin shear, Burgers vector and all templating kinetics are constants not exposed on the CLI (L117-138) (-1). Net -3 from v2." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py L1384–L1398: DEFECT: Panel A extents and grids use DEFAULT_A0_UM, not the --a0 override; c_thresh only sets the contour level <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py#L1384-L1398>",
            "models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py L1842–L1849: DEFECT: measure_morphoeval() calls evaluate_all_morphospace_regimes(), evaluate_gibson_ashby_and_cross_taxa(), segment_crinoid_stereom_specimen() and compute_pass3_models() with defaults — CLI overrides never reach the measurements <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py#L1842-L1849>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-parameter-expressivity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-parameter-expressivity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-parameter-expressivity-3> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.88"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

